Runtime images
--------------
Theme wallpapers are downloaded at runtime from the Wikimedia Commons API (CC0, public domain,
CC BY, CC BY-SA only). Each image's creator, source and licence are stored with it and shown on
screen. No third-party images ship inside the APK.
